## BusinessAccessInviteApi

### Create a request to access an existing partner&#39;s assets.
## Create a request to access an existing partner&#39;s assets.
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/requests/assets/access
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "asset_requests": "<string>"
}


### Cancel invites/requests
## Cancel invites/requests
DELETE https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/invites
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "invite_ids": "<string>"
}


### Update invite/request with an asset permission
## Update invite/request with an asset permission
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/invites/assets/access
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "invites": "<string>"
}


### Create invites or requests
## Create invites or requests
POST https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/invites
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "business_role": "<string>",
 "invite_type": "<string>",
 "members": "<string>",
 "partners": "<string>"
}


### Get invites/requests
## Get invites/requests
GET https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/{{business_id}}/invites?isMember={{isMember}}&inviteStatus={{inviteStatus}}&inviteType={{inviteType}}&bookmark={{bookmark}}&pageSize={{pageSize}}
Accept: application/json

### Accept or decline an invite/request
## Accept or decline an invite/request
PATCH https://api.pinterest.com/v5/businesses/invites
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
 "invites": "<string>"
}

